{
  "name": "GAS 基礎文字佔位符替換",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📜 範例 1：GAS 基礎文字佔位符替換\n\n1. **範本設計**：在 Google Docs 建立含有 `{{CUSTOMER_NAME}}`、`{{COMPANY_NAME}}`、`{{DATE}}` 的文件範本。\n2. **n8n 發送資料**：透過 HTTP Request 節點將客戶資料以 JSON 傳送至 GAS Web App。\n3. **GAS 自動複製與替換**：自動複製公版範本、替換佔位符文字並回傳新文件網址。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        100
      ],
      "id": "gas-text-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -180,
        380
      ],
      "id": "manual-trigger-gas-1",
      "name": "手動觸發測試"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "customerName",
              "value": "陳大明"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "未來科技股份有限公司"
            },
            {
              "name": "projectTitle",
              "value": "n8n 企業自動化系統導入專案"
            },
            {
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        80,
        380
      ],
      "id": "set-customer-data",
      "name": "準備套版資料"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_GAS_WEB_APP_ID/exec",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"templateId\": \"YOUR_GOOGLE_DOC_TEMPLATE_ID\",\n  \"folderId\": \"YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID\",\n  \"customerName\": \"{{ $json.customerName }}\",\n  \"companyName\": \"{{ $json.companyName }}\",\n  \"projectTitle\": \"{{ $json.projectTitle }}\",\n  \"date\": \"{{ $json.date }}\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        340,
        380
      ],
      "id": "http-call-gas-webapp",
      "name": "呼叫 GAS Web App 套版",
      "credentials": {}
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "手動觸發測試": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "準備套版資料",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "準備套版資料": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "呼叫 GAS Web App 套版",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
